{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-source-fusion-provenance","title":"多源知识融合、冲突消解与数据溯源工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/knowledge-graph-ontology-linked-data-engineering/kg-construction-extraction-fusion/multi-source-fusion-provenance","wordCount":2697,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"多源知识融合-冲突消解与数据溯源工程\">多源知识融合、冲突消解与数据溯源工程</h1><p>同一张集装箱在船公司 EDI、报关行系统、货代 CRM 与卖家后台里各有各的记录。四方数据一旦进图，最先爆发的不是「数据不够」，而是「数据打架」：同一票货的目的港，一处写 Rotterdam，一处在返单后改成了 Antwerp；同一承运人有两个 IRI；同一条 HS 编码归类，两个来源给出不同章节号。本文讲这层工程：把多源断言融成一张一致图，在冲突处作出有依据的取值决策，并让每一个决策都能溯源到来源、时间与依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>**知识融合（knowledge fusion）**指把多个来源对同一现实世界的断言，合并成一张不矛盾、可查询的图；**冲突消解（conflict resolution）**是其中在冲突点作出取值决策的环节；**数据溯源（provenance）**是记录每条断言「由谁、何时、依据什么产生」的元数据层。三者不是三个阶段，而是同一个循环：溯源是冲突消解的依据，冲突消解的结论又写回溯源。核心判断是——<strong>融合不是丢弃数据，而是在保留全部原始断言的前提下，另建一张有据可循的规范视图</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融合的四个层次\">融合的四个层次</h2><p>「融合」不是单一动作。工程上按抽象层从低到高拆成四层，越往上越接近知识、代价也越高：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>融什么</th>\n<th>典型冲突</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据层</td>\n<td>相同字段的不同格式</td>\n<td>日期格式、单位、编码</td>\n<td>归一化、单位换算、ETF 映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例层</td>\n<td>指向同一现实对象的记录</td>\n<td>同实体多 IRI</td>\n<td>实体解析（blocking + matching + clustering）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式层</td>\n<td>不同本体的同名/异名概念</td>\n<td><code>:Port</code> vs <code>:Seaport</code></td>\n<td>本体对齐、等价公理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识层</td>\n<td>相互矛盾的事实本身</td>\n<td>目的港 A vs B</td>\n<td>真值发现、投票、源可信度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四层的顺序不可乱：实例没合并就做事实合并，会把「同一条边被写成两条」误判成「两个来源冲突」。KGGraph 实践中常见的反模式是跳过实例层直接比对三元组，结果冲突数虚高一到两个数量级。</p>\n<p>模式层的融合产物是<strong>对齐公理</strong>，用 OWL 表达，最弱但最安全的是 <code>owl:sameAs</code> 之外的三元组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"turtle\" data-code=\":Port   owl:equivalentClass  ex:Seaport .&#10;ex:containerNumber  owl:equivalentProperty  ex:cntrNo .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:Port   owl:equivalentClass  ex:Seaport .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ex:containerNumber  owl:equivalentProperty  ex:cntrNo .</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>owl:equivalentClass</code> 会引发推理机把两侧类的外延合并，量级大时推理爆炸。工程上更常用 <code>skos:exactMatch</code> / <code>skos:closeMatch</code> 这类弱声明，把合并决策留给实例层而非推理机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突的本质-谁在什么条件下说了这句话\">冲突的本质：谁在什么条件下说了这句话</h2><p>一条断言写到图里之前，先要问清楚它的元问题：<strong>由谁、在何时、依据什么说的</strong>。这三个变量决定了冲突时该信谁。</p>\n<p>真值发现（truth discovery）把「一个来源的可靠度」与「一条断言的真值」看成互相依赖的两个未知量，用 EM 式迭代同时估计。Yin 等人在 VLDB 2008 提出的 TruthFinder 用来源间的一致性反推信赖度：来源越常与其他来源一致，越可信；越可信的来源提供的信息，越被采信。这类方法的形式是一个不动点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{t}_i = \\frac{\\sum_{s \\in S_i} w_s \\cdot v_{s,i}}{\\sum_{s \\in S_i} w_s}, \\qquad w_s = f\\!\\left(\\{t_i\\}_{i \\in I_s}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0285em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6256em;vertical-align:-1.0858em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5398em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3998em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0