n><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0858em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是来源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的可信度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是断言 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的真值，两者交替更新直到收敛。这不是「多数票」——多数票假设所有来源等价、且相互独立，而现实中报关行与船公司数据常同源（都来自同一家口岸平台），独立性假设直接失效。</p>\n<p>真实的多源融合必须区分三类冲突，因为消解策略完全不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[多源断言入库] --&gt; B{冲突分类}&#10;  B --&gt; C[时间性冲突&lt;br/&gt;同一对象在不同时点取值不同]&#10;  B --&gt; D[来源性冲突&lt;br/&gt;同一时点不同来源给出不同值]&#10;  B --&gt; E[语义性冲突&lt;br/&gt;两侧说的是不同概念]&#10;  C --&gt; F[按 validFrom/validUntil 保留双版本&lt;br/&gt;不消解]&#10;  D --&gt; G[按源可信度+时效投票&lt;br/&gt;保留候选与票型]&#10;  E --&gt; H[回到模式层对齐&lt;br/&gt;或拆分实体]\">flowchart TD\n  A[多源断言入库] --&gt; B{冲突分类}\n  B --&gt; C[时间性冲突&lt;br/&gt;同一对象在不同时点取值不同]\n  B --&gt; D[来源性冲突&lt;br/&gt;同一时点不同来源给出不同值]\n  B --&gt; E[语义性冲突&lt;br/&gt;两侧说的是不同概念]\n  C --&gt; F[按 validFrom/validUntil 保留双版本&lt;br/&gt;不消解]\n  D --&gt; G[按源可信度+时效投票&lt;br/&gt;保留候选与票型]\n  E --&gt; H[回到模式层对齐&lt;br/&gt;或拆分实体]</pre><p>时间性冲突<strong>不该被消解</strong>。目的港从 Rotterdam 改到 Antwerp 不是矛盾，是改单（amendment）。正确做法是保留两条带时间窗的断言，让查询按时间点取。硬投票会把改单历史抹平，事后追责时无法复原。</p>\n<p>来源性冲突才需要取值决策：同一时点、同一谓词、不同来源。语义性冲突是假冲突，根因在上游的模式对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"溯源建模-prov-o-与-rdf-1-2-的两条路\">溯源建模：PROV-O 与 RDF 1.2 的两条路</h2><p>溯源不是「记个 source 字段」，而是把「实体—活动—代理」三要素显式建模。W3C 的 PROV-O 规范（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/</a>）给出了这套词汇表的权威定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Entity（实体）</strong>：一条断言、一个融合后的实体。</li>\n<li><strong>Activity（活动）</strong>：产生该断言的抽取或融合过程。</li>\n<li><strong>Agent（代理）</strong>：负责该活动的模型、流水线或人。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"turtle\" data-code=\":FusedPortAssertion a prov:Entity ;&#10;  prov:wasGeneratedBy :Fusion20260602 ;&#10;  prov:wasDerivedFrom &lt;doc://edi/manifest/88213&gt; ;&#10;  prov:wasAttributedTo :CustomsBrokerSys .&#10;&#10;:Fusion20260602 a prov:Activity ;&#10;  prov:startedAtTime &quot;2026-06-02T03:11:00Z&quot;^^xsd:dateTime ;&#10;  prov:used :SourceAssertionA , :SourceAssertionB .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:FusedPortAssertion a prov:Entity ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prov:wasGeneratedBy :Fusion20260602 ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prov:wasDerivedFrom &#x3C;doc://edi/manifest/88213> ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prov:wasAttributedTo :CustomsBrokerSys .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:Fusion20260602 a prov:Activity ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prov:startedAtTime \"2026-06-02T03:11:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prov:used :SourceAssertionA , :SourceAssertionB .</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二条路是把溯源<strong>直接挂到三元组上</strong>。W3C 正在标准化的 RDF 1.2 把原 RDF-star 的 triple term 纳入正式规范（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf12-concepts/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf12-concepts/</a>），使「给一条边挂时间、置信度、来源」成为一等语法，而不必为每条断言建一个具体化节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"turtle\" data-code=\"&lt;&lt; :cntr8841 :destinationPort :Rotterdam &gt;&gt;&#10;   :validFrom &quot;2026-05-01&quot;^^xsd:date ;&#10;   :confidence 0.93 ;&#10;   :provSource &lt;doc://edi/manifest/88213&gt; .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;&#x3C; :cntr8841 :destinationPort :Rotterdam >></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   :validFrom \"2026-05-01\"^^xsd:date ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   :confidence 0.93 ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   :provSource &#x3C;doc://edi/manifest/88213> .</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两条路的取舍很实际：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>PROV-O 独立节点</th>\n<th>RDF 1.2 triple term</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准成熟度</td>\n<td>2013 年 W3C 推荐，工具链完备</td>\n<td>规范化进行中，工具支持在成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图规模</td>\n<td>每条断言多 3–5 个节点</td>\n<td>元数据内联，膨胀小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询复杂度</td>\n<td>需 join 多个 prov 节点</td>\n<td>直接在 triple term 上加约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与老三元组库兼容</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>依赖库版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地建议是<strong>分层用</strong>：断言级的时间、置信度、来源 doc ID 用 triple term 内联（高频、量大的元数据）；跨批次的流水线活动、责任人、审批链用 PROV-O 独立节点（低频、需审计的元数据）。把全部溯源都建成 PROV-O 节点会让图膨胀数倍，把全部溯源都塞进 triple term 又会丢失活动的聚合语义。</p>\n<p>命名图（named graph）是第三条正交的轴：把每一批次的融合输出放进独立图 <code>:batch_20260602</code>，变更时整体替换某一批次，而不必逐条 diff。查询时用 <code>GRAPH</code> 子句按批次过滤，回滚成本从「逐条比对」降到「整体换图」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融合流水线-从原始断言到规范实体\">融合流水线：从原始断言到规范实体</h2><p>把前面几层串成一个可重放的流水线，核心是「<strong>先尽最大努力合并，但永不销毁原始断言</strong>」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[多源原始断言&lt;br/&gt;各自带 provenance] --&gt; B[归一化&lt;br/&gt;单位/编码/日期]&#10;  B --&gt; C[实体解析&lt;br/&gt;blocking + matching + clustering]&#10;  C --&gt; D[冲突分组&lt;br/&gt;按主语+谓词聚合取值集]&#10;  D --&gt; E[冲突分类&lt;br/&gt;时间/来源/语义]&#10;  E --&gt; F[取值决策&lt;br/&gt;时间窗保留 OR 可信度投票]&#10;  F --&gt; G[写出规范三元组&lt;br/&gt;canonical graph]&#10;  A -.保留.-&gt; H[原始断言图&lt;br/&gt;raw assertion graph]&#10;  G --&gt; I[SHACL 形状校验]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[多源原始断言&lt;br/&gt;各自带 provenance] --&gt; B[归一化&lt;br/&gt;单位/编码/日期]\n  B --&gt; C[实体解析&lt;br/&gt;blocking + matching + clustering]\n  C --&gt; D[冲突分组&lt;br/&gt;按主语+谓词聚合取值集]\n  D --&gt; E[冲突分类&lt;br/&gt;时间/来源/语义]\n  E --&gt; F[取值决策&lt;br/&gt;时间窗保留 OR 可信度投票]\n  F --&gt; G[写出规范三元组&lt;br/&gt;canonical graph]\n  A -.保留.-&gt; H[原始断言图&lt;br/&gt;raw assertion graph]\n  G --&gt; I[SHACL 形状校验]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>融合流水线的输入端，是上一步抽取出的原始断言——每条都必须已经携带来源文档 ID、抽取模型版本与置信度，其构造方式见同章的 <a href=\"text-triple-extraction-pipeline\">从非结构化文本抽取三元组</a>。融合层拿到的是这些带溯源断言的集合，而不是裸三元组。</p>\n<p>三个工程约束决定这条流水线能否长期运维：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>原始断言永不删除。</strong> 融合是错误的可撤销动作。规范图里一条错误的合并，其修复依据只能是上游原始断言。删掉上游，等于把修复路径也删了。用命名图隔离 raw 与 canonical，规范图可整体重建。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>取值决策必须留下票型。</strong> 冲突被消解后，落地的不能只是「结果是 A」，还要记「A 得 3 票、B 得 1 票、C 被时效规则降权」。当业务方质疑「为什么是 A」，答案在票型里，而非重新跑一遍流水线。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>决策规则要版本化。</strong> 源可信度权重、时效半衰期、投票阈值的任何调整都会改变输出。把规则配置单独版本化，融合结果带上 <code>:decidedBy &quot;fusion-rules-v7&quot;</code>，才能在规则演进后回放某一历史时点的图谱快照。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个常被低估的细节是<strong>时效衰减</strong>。物流数据里「昨天报关行的申报」比「三个月前的船公司记录」更可能代表当前事实，但三个月前那条可能正是改单前的原始依据。取用时按半衰期给权重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{eff}} = w_{s} \\cdot 2^{-\\Delta t / T_{1/2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5357em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3695em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按谓词分别设定：港口、承运人这类可变更状态取短半衰期（如 30 天）；HS 编码归类、原产地规则这类低频变更取长半衰期（如 2 年）。用同一半衰期处理所有谓词，必然在某一类上出系统性偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量校验与融合评估\">质量校验与融合评估</h2><p>融合输出必须过形状校验才能进规范图。W3C 的 SHACL（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/</a>）用「形状」声明断言必须满足的约束，比 OWL 的开放世界推理更适合数据校验——SHACL 是封闭世界，缺失即违规：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"turtle\" data-code=\":PortAssertionShape a sh:NodeShape ;&#10;  sh:targetClass :PortAssertion ;&#10;  sh:property [ sh:path :destinationPort ;&#10;                sh:minCount 1 ;&#10;                sh:maxCount 1 ;&#10;                sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ] ;&#10;  sh:property [ sh:path :confidence ;&#10;                sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;&#10;                sh:minInclusive 0.0 ; sh:maxInclusive 1.0 ] .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:PortAssertionShape a sh:NodeShape ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sh:targetClass :PortAssertion ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sh:property [ sh:path :destinationPort ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:minCount 1 ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:maxCount 1 ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ] ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sh:property [ sh:path :confidence ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:minInclusive 0.0 ; sh:maxInclusive 1.0 ] .</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sh:maxCount 1</code> 正是用来挡「融合后仍残留多条冲突值」这类错误的——若某主语的 <code>:destinationPort</code> 投票后仍留两条，形状校验直接报违规，避免脏数据静默入库。</p>\n<p>融合质量不能只看冲突消解率。三个口径要同时报：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>盯什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合并精度</td>\n<td>合并对中真同实的比例</td>\n<td>误合并（把两票货并成一票）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并召回</td>\n<td>真同实对被合并的比例</td>\n<td>漏合并（同一票货留两个 IRI）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突消解准确率</td>\n<td>取值决策与金标准的吻合度</td>\n<td>决策规则是否选错来源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>误合并的代价远高于漏合并：漏合并只是多一条冗余边，误合并会把两票不同货的轨迹搅在一起，任一查询都出错、且难以定位。因此实体解析的阈值应偏保守，宁留冗余，不做过早合并。</p>\n<p>评估要跑固定的回归查询集。模型或规则一变，重跑同一批 SPARQL，比「融合准确率涨了 2%」更能说明是否真的变好——常出现的情况是融合指标改善、而下游「改单历史能否复原」这类时序查询反而变差，因为新的消解规则把时间窗压掉了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>融合分<strong>数据/实例/模式/知识</strong>四层，顺序不可颠倒；实例层没合并就做事实合并，会把冗余误判为冲突。</li>\n<li>冲突要分<strong>时间性、来源性、语义性</strong>三类：时间性冲突按时间窗保留双版本（改单不是矛盾），来源性冲突用真值发现按源可信度与时效取值，语义性冲突回到模式层对齐。</li>\n<li>溯源有两条正交的路：PROV-O 独立节点管活动与责任链，RDF 1.2 triple term 管断言级的时间/置信度/来源；命名图用于按批次整体回滚。</li>\n<li>融合流水线的铁律是<strong>原始断言永不删除、取值决策留下票型、决策规则版本化</strong>——三者共同保证融合可重放、可审计、可回退。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多源知识融合、冲突消解与数据溯源工程","id":"多源知识融合-冲突消解与数据溯源工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"融合的四个层次","id":"融合的四个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突的本质：谁在什么条件下说了这句话","id":"冲突的本质-谁在什么条件下说了这句话"},{"level":2,"text":"溯源建模：PROV-O 与 RDF 1.2 的两条路","id":"溯源建模-prov-o-与-rdf-1-2-的两条路"},{"level":2,"text":"融合流水线：从原始断言到规范实体","id":"融合流水线-从原始断言到规范实体"},{"level":2,"text":"质量校验与融合评估","id":"质量校验与融合评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"关系型与半结构化数据到 RDF 的映射：R2RML 与图谱 ETL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/knowledge-graph-ontology-linked-data-engineering/kg-construction-extraction-fusion/r2rml-mapping-etl"},"next":{"title":"实体解析问题建模：阻塞、相似度度量与聚类决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/knowledge-graph-ontology-linked-data-engineering/entity-resolution-graph-quality/entity-resolution-modeling-blocking"}}